          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("For with each fight, we gain experience and grow stronger! If I have any veteran soldiers from the last battle, I may wish to recall them so they can continue to gain experience and eventually gain a promotion."),
          },
        ],
