          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Urza Fastik",
            text: _("What’s this? Soldiers on the road from Tahn — that can only mean my brother Mathin is dead! Curses... the master should never have sent him here alongside me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Urza Fastik",
            text: _("I will avenge him. You fools will get no further, for I am second of the Urza brothers, and much more powerful than my late elder. Behold!"),
