            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Another Urza brother, augmenting his ranks with the restless dead. The brothers must have been waiting on the road for travelers, ambushing civilians and raising their corpses as minions."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I know banditry is not uncommon in the lawless south, but necromancy!? Where is the rest of the South Guard? How have things gotten so far out of control?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_19",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_20",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("Meanwhile, I’ll sneak past and get in contact with Westin — someone in town better know what’s going on here. If we’re lucky, I’ll return with reinforcements."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Going alone? That sounds dangerous. What happened to staying an observer?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Mari",
            x: 19,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "stored_mari",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Mari",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Well then. I hope Mari returns with the rest of the South Guard, but I shouldn’t count on it. I may only be a junior commander, but this outlaw underestimates me if he thinks I can’t beat him on my own."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_21",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
