              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Ha, this zombie is so slow and weak! Usually, moving next to an enemy unit prevents me from moving any further. But this frail, feeble Walking Corpse is easy to outmaneuver."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<span color=' <<'> + _Unlike most units, level 0 units (such as Walking Corpses) do not exert a Zone of Control. Your units can move freely around them.</span>"),
          },
        ],
